5,1,1,talk,May,,Hi everyone! Let's figure out what to do with the break room. I want to make sure we don't just guess and end up with a mess. Let's look at some facts first!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We should avoid making a decision based on assumptions. Let's examine the data to understand how the room is actually being used and what the primary issues are.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be here with you all. A shared space is like a garden; it flourishes only when we understand the soil we are planting in. Let us seek the truth together.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery to solve! I'm so excited to help! Let's find some super cool clues so we can make the room the best place ever! What should we look for first?,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm in! Let's make this room a place where we can all hang out and really get to know each other. I'm ready to dive in and find some answers!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"I'll check the ""Crumbs and bins at the desks"" and the ""Fortnight's tally of use by person."" I want to see who's actually using the space and who's leaving the mess behind!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I will look into the ""Facilities callouts on this floor"" and ""Crumbs and bins at the desks."" I want to identify the specific sources of noise and mess that are affecting the surrounding workspace.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I shall examine the ""Invoices for outside hire by the hour"" and the ""Fortnight's tally of use by person."" It is wise to understand where our time and resources are truly flowing before we build.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I want to see the ""Invoices for outside hire by the hour"" and the ""Quotes for the two fit-outs""! I bet there are some secret numbers in there that will tell us everything!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'll check ""Unplanned talk since the refit"" and ""Where the last awkward conversation happened""! I want to see how we've been talking to each other and if we have a good spot for the tough stuff!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, looks like we're both hunting for crumbs! I'm curious if we'll find the same culprits. @Kenji, ""awkward conversations""? Now that sounds like some juicy gossip! I can't wait to hear what you find.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, I am not looking for culprits, but for patterns. If we can identify the cause of the mess, we can find a structural solution rather than just blaming individuals.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a gentle reminder that patterns are indeed the whispers of the past. By observing these rhythms, we can ensure that our future arrangement brings peace and ease to everyone's daily journey.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, you talk so fancy! It's like a storybook! I hope the secret numbers I find are just as magical. I wonder if the fit-outs have cool colors or maybe a secret snack drawer!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, a secret snack drawer would be awesome! But I'm more interested in how we're actually getting along. I hope we can find a way to make the room a place where we can all be honest and close!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,I'm feeling the energy! Let's all go do our digging and see what secrets the room is hiding. I'll be waiting to see who the real mess-makers are! See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will begin my research now. I hope the data on facilities and cleanliness provides a clear picture of the room's impact on our work environment. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I shall step away now to reflect upon the records. May your search be fruitful and your hearts open to what the data reveals. I look forward to our reunion. Until then, be well.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm off to find those secret numbers! I'll be the best detective ever! I can't wait to see if there are any surprises waiting for us! Bye-bye everyone, see you soon!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm on it! I'll go see what's been happening with our conversations. I really hope we can turn this room into a place where we all feel like best friends! See you all soon!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
